", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jack: </span>  Hi, Anna. Thank you for your help. I couldn't attend class yesterday. What did you study? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ana: </span>  We learned that software can be categorized into application software and system software.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jack: </span> Oh no! I missed the explanation.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ana: </span>  Yes, you did, but let me explain. Application software refers to the computer system and special functions, but system software refers to the computer hardware and other platforms to run application software. In other words, it is used to support, control and run the computer.<br/>"}, {"time": "33000", "image": "enpe8n1le02ob03re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jack: </span>  Can you give me some examples of system software? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Anna: </span>  System software can include device drivers, operating systems, utilities, and malware. For example: when you turn on your computer the operating system allows hardware devices to talk to each other, it can control the way they work. Every computer has an operating system like Mac, Windows, and Linux. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jack: </span> Ok, it is clear. And, can you give me some examples of application software? <br/>"}, {"time": "62500", "image": "enpe8n1le02ob03re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Anna: </span>  Yes, I can. Remember, application software is different from system software. That is to say, the application software is the productivity programs because they can enable the user to complete a task. For example, imagine you have a new computer and you only have Windows. Windows offers some basic utility programs like the calculator. If you need to add some numbers up, you can do it with this utility, but if you need to do a more specialized task then you need to install some application software on the computer. This application software can be the Word processor or spreadsheet to do projects or research.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jack: </span> I understand. The application software is a definition we use to describe programs we usually buy or develop to perform a specific task. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Anna: </span>  Exactly!"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n1le02ob03re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar"}]}